1
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:40,400
I'll give you a month.

2
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:41,840
If you don't come back,

3
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:43,200
I'll hang myself right here

4
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:45,460
and turn your nursing home into a morgue.

5
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:59,600
Excuse me, why did you hit me?

6
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:01,360
You're a homewrecker.

7
00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:03,320
Didn't you expect to get beaten up?

8
00:01:03,680 --> 00:01:06,340
You bought this dress
with his card, didn't you?

9
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:08,170
You've milked him for a lot.

10
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:09,080
Before you beat up a homewrecker,

11
00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:10,880
could you at least make sure
you have the right person?

12
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:12,120
This dress I'm wearing...

13
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:14,920
I bought it with the money
I earned fair and square.

14
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:17,560
You call gold-digging fair and square?

15
00:01:18,039 --> 00:01:18,760
Take it off.

16
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:20,080
Why should I?

17
00:01:21,360 --> 00:01:22,800
You bought it with my family's money.

18
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:24,600
What right do you have to wear it?

19
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:26,280
Are you going to take it off yourself,
or should I do it?

20
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:27,200
I won't.

21
00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:29,200
Take it off. What are you doing?

22
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:29,920
Take it off.

23
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:31,840
I won't.

24
00:01:35,520 --> 00:01:36,960
Even if she's the other woman,

25
00:01:36,960 --> 00:01:37,560
you can't force her

26
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:39,320
to strip in public.

27
00:01:39,479 --> 00:01:40,759
And when this kind of thing happens,

28
00:01:40,759 --> 00:01:41,880
it's always the woman's fault.

29
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:43,560
The cheating man is completely blameless.

30
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:44,840
Sorry to interrupt.

31
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:46,960
Thank you for speaking up for me,

32
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:48,479
but I'm really not the other woman.

33
00:01:48,479 --> 00:01:50,080
It's really beautiful here.

34
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:53,100
Yeah.
The local environment shapes its people.

35
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:53,759
If you want to get to know me...

36
00:01:53,759 --> 00:01:55,280
She is my dad's mistress.

37
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:58,280
You definitely need to learn
about my hometown first.

38
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:06,400
They actually bought the same outfit.

39
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:12,490
Rongrong, what are you doing here?

40
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:14,240
Let me explain.

41
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:17,240
Yue Yingying,

42
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:19,520
shouldn't you explain

43
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:21,680
why you're with my dad?

44
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:23,960
This has nothing to do with Yingying.

45
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:24,760
It was me.

46
00:02:26,160 --> 00:02:26,960
Rongrong!

47
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:30,250
After all, we've been best friends
for so many years.

48
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,240
Best friend,

49
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:33,240
I didn't mean to hide it from you.

50
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:35,460
I just didn't know how to tell you.

51
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:37,640
Rongrong, I'm sorry.

52
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:39,520
You won't blame me, will you?

53
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:45,880
You two really put on a good show.

54
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:46,840
I can't believe

55
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:49,040
I didn't notice your affair for so long.

56
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:50,160
What's going on?

57
00:02:50,160 --> 00:02:50,880
Rongrong,

58
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:53,600
Yingying and I truly love each other.

59
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:56,040
If you want to blame someone for this,
blame Dad.

60
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:56,880
Besides,

61
00:02:57,320 --> 00:03:00,400
Yingying is already pregnant
with your little brother.

62
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:01,880
Little brother?

63
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:07,640
Are you the owner of this guesthouse?

64
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:09,080
I'm the acting manager.

65
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:10,220
Acting for a month.

66
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:14,740
Sorry about what happened this morning.

67
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:16,720
Is that how you apologize?

68
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:21,000
This is my attitude.

69
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:25,200
It's not Ms. Shu's fault.

70
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:26,280
I have bad taste.

71
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:28,120
I shouldn't have bought that dress.

72
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:30,120
I have another favor to ask of you.

73
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:32,160
If you help me out, money is not an issue.

74
00:03:32,160 --> 00:03:33,640
Just say the word, Ms. Shu.

75
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:35,840
I've got what it takes.

76
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:38,520
They plan to hold their
engagement ceremony here.

77
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,050
I need you to turn them down.

78
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:43,600
That might be a bit difficult.

79
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:45,200
They booked the venue

80
00:03:45,320 --> 00:03:46,800
two weeks ago.

81
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:49,800
Isn't this a youth retirement home?

82
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:51,280
Why do you take this kind of business?

83
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:52,680
It's just a gimmick.

84
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:55,120
It's no different
from a regular guesthouse.

85
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:58,000
Fine. Name your price for the penalty,

86
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,360
and I'll pay it.

87
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:00,680
It's not about the money.

88
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:01,880
Once we take an order,

89
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:03,000
we don't break the contract

90
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:04,280
without a special reason.

91
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:06,480
Although Yunbianshang is a small shop,

92
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:09,080
we have our own principles and ethics.

93
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:10,600
Besides,

94
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:12,560
since it already happened,

95
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,600
you should solve
your family's internal problems

96
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:15,240
from the root.

97
00:04:15,440 --> 00:04:17,480
Even if he doesn't hold
the engagement ceremony here,

98
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:19,140
he'll just go somewhere else.

99
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:22,640
I'll handle this matter myself.

100
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:25,160
Then please get me a room.

101
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:26,480
I want the best one here.

102
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:28,280
Our best room

103
00:04:28,440 --> 00:04:30,360
is a luxury suite

104
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:31,800
with an infinity pool.

105
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:34,920
It's just that the cost is a bit...

106
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:36,600
Book it.

107
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:38,730
Sure thing, Ms. Shu. This way, please.

108
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:45,320
Thanks for speaking up for me just now.

109
00:04:45,320 --> 00:04:47,720
But why did you follow me to Yunbian?

110
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,520
Me? You're afraid I'll commit suicide?

111
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:52,680
Don't worry. I won't die for now.

112
00:04:52,880 --> 00:04:54,720
You don't have to keep staring at me.

113
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:56,050
That's not why I'm here.

114
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,680
Then why are you here?

115
00:05:00,080 --> 00:05:00,880
Are you also

116
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:02,800
a creditor of Yunbian?

117
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:05,760
Yes, you owe me a lot.

118
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:10,080
My friend is already
trying to raise money.

119
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:12,800
She also asked me
to help manage this shop.

120
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,240
Look, we have business.

121
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,480
We can raise the money.

122
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,720
Don't worry too much.

123
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:19,560
Speaking of which,

124
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:21,240
I still don't know your name.

125
00:05:21,960 --> 00:05:22,960
What do you think?

126
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,240
That's not very appropriate.

127
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,400
We just met,

128
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:29,160
and you want me to name you?

129
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:30,880
You're not a cat or a dog.

130
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,980
Remember it this time.

131
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:46,250
My name is Shen Feng.

132
00:05:54,840 --> 00:05:55,880
Is it Shen Feng

133
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,800
or psycho?

134
00:05:58,840 --> 00:06:00,160
So weird.

135
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:07,970
In tranquility, they transcended
the traps of passion,

136
00:06:08,080 --> 00:06:10,360
the ruthless mockery of illusions,

137
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:12,160
the mirage of disillusionment,

138
00:06:12,520 --> 00:06:13,720
and love itself.

139
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:16,040
No matter when or where,

140
00:06:16,440 --> 00:06:18,600
love is always love.

141
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:21,360
It's just that the closer to death,

142
00:06:21,880 --> 00:06:23,610
the more intense love becomes.

143
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:26,360
Ariza proved to us

144
00:06:26,640 --> 00:06:28,440
that love can happen at any age,

145
00:06:28,760 --> 00:06:30,480
transcending time and death

146
00:06:30,840 --> 00:06:32,040
to achieve eternity.

147
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:37,320
Ye,

148
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:41,090
we are so lucky to live
in such a beautiful era.

149
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,360
We are so lucky

150
00:06:43,080 --> 00:06:44,360
to have met each other.

151
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:48,240
It's just a pity I didn't meet you sooner.

152
00:06:48,280 --> 00:06:49,840
I owe you so much.

153
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,000
But don't worry.

154
00:06:51,280 --> 00:06:52,920
As long as you give birth to our son,

155
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:55,360
I'll set up an overseas fund for you.

156
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:56,800
In the future, the shares of my company

157
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:58,200
will also belong to our son.

158
00:06:58,200 --> 00:07:00,000
And that villa abroad...

159
00:07:00,200 --> 00:07:02,660
I'll leave it
for your postpartum recovery.

160
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:04,760
Ye,

161
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,600
you know

162
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:08,160
none of this matters.

163
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:09,720
What matters is

164
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:11,280
that you are by my side.

165
00:07:22,640 --> 00:07:23,640
My bedsheets!

166
00:07:26,640 --> 00:07:28,000
I'm so sorry.

167
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:29,360
It's okay.

168
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,560
Our Cupid,

169
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:32,600
can you make a sun shower for us?

170
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:54,200
These two are so immersed in their love

171
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:56,130
that they've forgotten the world.

172
00:07:56,320 --> 00:07:57,800
I worked so hard,

173
00:07:58,240 --> 00:07:59,640
but the sheets are hung for nothing,

174
00:07:59,640 --> 00:08:01,200
the flowers watered for nothing,

175
00:08:01,200 --> 00:08:02,660
and I got a mouthful of PDA.

176
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:07,680
Fun fact,

177
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:09,480
humans don't need watering.

178
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:11,280
I'm the NPC of their romance,

179
00:08:11,280 --> 00:08:13,140
creating iconic scenes for them.

180
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:15,640
Mr. Shu,

181
00:08:16,640 --> 00:08:18,440
the tea you ordered has arrived.

182
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:19,200
Okay.

183
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:23,080
I heard the Dafo Longjing tea
from Xinchang is quite good,

184
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:24,880
so I ordered some from Mr. Shen.

185
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:28,320
Please brew it for us, Manager Yun.

186
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:30,520
Me?

187
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:35,299
I happen to know a little
about the tea ceremony.

188
00:08:36,559 --> 00:08:39,200
Step one, add boiling water.

189
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:43,840
The first step is to remove the lid
and add the tea,

190
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:45,440
then let the leaves unfurl.

191
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:47,400
Right,

192
00:08:47,520 --> 00:08:48,640
look at my memory.

193
00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:53,080
Remove the lid and put in the tea,

194
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:08,640
and then add boiling water again.

195
00:09:18,680 --> 00:09:20,080
Then scrape off the foam.

196
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:25,960
Hover.

197
00:09:31,520 --> 00:09:33,320
I can't believe the lid fell off.

198
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:35,840
Let's try again. Hover.

199
00:09:36,920 --> 00:09:38,120
It's okay. It's okay.

200
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:40,040
Then what's next?

201
00:09:41,040 --> 00:09:42,520
Then rub the tea.

202
00:09:43,560 --> 00:09:44,280
Rub the tea.

203
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:47,800
Hot, hot, hot!

204
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:51,200
Shake the tea

205
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,800
to release the aroma.

206
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:55,760
Hot, hot, hot!

207
00:09:56,640 --> 00:09:58,700
The last step is the butterfly dance.

208
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,160
So hot!

209
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:05,160
No more butterfly dance.

210
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:09,440
Let me do it.

211
00:10:10,760 --> 00:10:12,240
I'm sorry.

212
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:16,600
Let me do it.

213
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:30,400
The first step is to scrape off the foam.

214
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:35,480
Hover.

215
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:38,200
Then rub the tea.

216
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:42,820
Release the aroma.

217
00:10:47,680 --> 00:10:48,680
Butterfly dance.

218
00:10:53,560 --> 00:10:54,290
Pour the tea.

219
00:10:58,240 --> 00:10:59,360
Guan Gong patrolling the city.

220
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,800
Freshly picked Dafo Longjing.

221
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:02,440
Mr. Shu, Ms. Yue,

222
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:03,320
please

223
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:07,360
have a taste.

224
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,680
It tastes fresh and crisp,

225
00:11:12,680 --> 00:11:15,280
and the tea is a bright, tender green.

226
00:11:15,520 --> 00:11:17,440
What a rare and excellent tea.

227
00:11:18,280 --> 00:11:18,960
Ye,

228
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:21,420
thank you for letting me
taste such good tea.

229
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,680
Does he have Iron Sand Palms?

230
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:26,540
He's not afraid of the heat at all.

231
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,760
We roast tea with our bare hands.

232
00:11:29,760 --> 00:11:32,360
With enough practice,
you get used to the heat.

233
00:11:32,560 --> 00:11:33,760
Where did you study?

234
00:11:33,760 --> 00:11:35,820
You'd be better off learning from me.

235
00:11:36,520 --> 00:11:37,600
Online tutorials.

236
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:40,260
Easy to understand,
but a disaster in practice.

237
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:42,600
Boss Shen, this is excellent

238
00:11:42,920 --> 00:11:43,480
tea.

239
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:44,810
You flatter me, Mr. Shu.

240
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:46,570
Come, let me pour you some more.

241
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:50,360
I'm a one-woman show here at Yunbianshang.

242
00:11:50,440 --> 00:11:52,080
I have to be the manager, the cleaner,

243
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:53,160
and the waitress.

244
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:55,720
I came here to die,

245
00:11:55,720 --> 00:11:57,040
not to find a job.

246
00:11:57,800 --> 00:11:59,660
My damn sense of responsibility.

247
00:11:59,680 --> 00:12:01,210
I'm a born corporate slave.

248
00:12:01,680 --> 00:12:04,080
The motto of a workhorse is indeed:

249
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:06,520
if you can work, you work forever.

250
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:12,120
I have to survive for another month.

251
00:12:12,560 --> 00:12:14,920
I need to stay healthy this month too.

252
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:21,680
My mind is already twisted,

253
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:23,480
so my body must be healthy.

254
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:30,480
My body got its nutrients,

255
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:32,920
and my spirit needs some too.

256
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:38,800
You have refollowed Fengguo Qingye.

257
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:41,520
I knew you couldn't bear to leave me.

258
00:12:41,680 --> 00:12:44,200
Does what you said last time still count?

259
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:46,130
Can I really watch whatever I want?

260
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:48,760
What do you want to watch?

261
00:12:58,240 --> 00:13:00,760
I want to see you shoot this. Can I?

262
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:05,460
You're the best male cook in our village.

263
00:13:05,760 --> 00:13:08,280
I'd die without your cooking.
